    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d153-a3">

                <pb facs="0568" n="446" xml:id="pg446"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States of America.</hi><lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1857-02-28"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 28, 1857</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 83.]</seg></opener>
                <p>I, the undersigned and consul of the United States of America for the City of
                    Mexico, hereby certify that I have this day carefully examined and compared the
                    foregoing document with the original record in this consulate No. 72, Register
                    1, folio 10, and that it is a true and faithful copy of said original record
                    register 1, folio 12.</p>
                <p>In testimony whereof I have hereunto set my hand and affixed the consular seal
                    the day and year first above written.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Black</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
